              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wathatha ezinye izancinza nabesifazane eJerusalema ngemva kokufika kwakhe evela eHebroni, uDavide wazalelwa amadodana namadodakazi amaningi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.13",
