        {
          "text": "Kwathi amaFilisti esezwile ukuthi bamgcobile uDavida abe yinkosi phezu kukaIsrayeli, wonke amaFilisti enyuka ukumdinga uDavida; uDavide wezwa, wehlela entabeni enqabeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.5.17",
